promptTemplate:
Bug report: {{task}}

Run the /fix workflow: two-phase reproduction before any production edit, approved plan before implementation, bounded rework on failure. The confirmed reproduction is an immutable oracle.

Hard rules: (1) The oracle must invoke the diagnosis-named production callables on the reporter path — a sibling API or newer stack is invalid even if it fails. (2) After repro_invalidated, rewrite the draft against that named seam; never checkpoint blocked because the previous seam was wrong or because a method news its own DbContext. (3) Search existing test hosts (controller fixtures, HttpContext helpers, TransactionScope, read-only call against existing data) before declaring a seam untestable.
